    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Milestone 4 v2\n\nThis workflow demonstrates:\n\n- webhook lead intake\n- FastAPI validation, dedupe, persistence, and AI classification\n- lookup of the processed lead\n- urgent / normal / manual-review branching\n- durable internal staff alerts for urgent and review cases\n- customer acknowledgement payloads\n- durable execution logging for every terminal branch\n\nLocal requirements:\n- FastAPI running on `127.0.0.1:8000`\n- n8n running locally\n- API patch `project1-milestone4-logging-and-staff-alerts.patch` applied\n\nTest webhook path:\n`/webhook-test/ai-lead-intake-v2`\n",
        "height": 300,
        "width": 520
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        0,
        0
      ],
